What to replace before shipping

The terminal output and the three stats are illustrative. Once the exemplar produces real numbers, paste them in — a landing page whose demo doesn't match what someone sees when they run it undermines the whole thing. The stats especially: "1× analysis per unit" is true by construction, but the other two should be things you can point at.

Same rule as everywhere else in your docs. Examples are real or they aren't there.
